+For every $A'$-module $Q$, there is a functorial isomorphism
+(\hyperref[V.prop1.5]{1.5}):
+$$
+Q\simeq \varinjlim_{\Vois(x)^{\circ}}x_V^{\ast}x_{V\ast}Q{\quoi}.
